/**
 * Deterministic news fixtures loaded by `npm run db:reset:test` (PRD S-5, docs/test-cases README 3.1/3.2).
 * Every timestamp is a literal anchored to 2026-09-30 Asia/Manila; nothing here reads the clock.
 * Row ids are generated by Postgres, so tests look rows up by alias -> canonical_url (see newsAliasToCanonicalUrl).
 */
